  "changes": [
    "Private Classic identifier; raised compact frame and immediate mouse-down feedback.",
    "Panel grid glyphs are centered inside the button rim, limited to 32 pixels above optional launcher labels, with immediate one-pixel pressed feedback. Native cell metrics, popup layout, keyboard navigation and drag/drop handlers remain unchanged.",
    "New Classic layouts store applications: desktop identifiers. QtCore.StandardPaths resolves these tokens through the current user's XDG application directories before native metadata, launching, editing and URL export; existing file URLs and saved model tokens are preserved.",
    "An explicit Organize Launchers context action opens a separate ordered configuration category. Add and Replace use the native KOpenWithDialog selector; Remove, Up and Down edit cfg_launcherUrls copies until Plasma Apply/OK, while Cancel leaves saved launchers untouched. Replace preserves its row and refuses stale nonmodal selections. Existing URL tokens, upstream source hashes, press feedback and drag handlers are preserved."
  ],
